            },
            {
                "entry_id": "bb1ad851-a771-3498-aabe-49bed2d6a26c",
                "word": "kremlin",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "68f0d67b-9125-40a7-acd3-2f1b212e6237",
                        "entry_id": "bb1ad851-a771-3498-aabe-49bed2d6a26c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "kremlins"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "df767ade-3653-4da0-9ed7-bb0372a33814",
                        "entry_id": "bb1ad851-a771-3498-aabe-49bed2d6a26c",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "kreml"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "9cdf9942-c06d-4330-ae8c-5dafd0481dc0",
                        "entry_id": "bb1ad851-a771-3498-aabe-49bed2d6a26c",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "Kremlin"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6655f2c4-ca74-322b-81c8-7a00fbdf80f9",
                        "entry_id": "bb1ad851-a771-3498-aabe-49bed2d6a26c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Partie centrale fortifiée d’une ville russe."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "30be4435-578f-4957-ad18-3784886dae59",
                                "sense_id": "6655f2c4-ca74-322b-81c8-7a00fbdf80f9",
                                "text": "Le premier jour les cosaques s’emparèrent d’assaut de la ville basse [Simbirsk] ; mais le kremlin, ou la ville haute, résista."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f758c0b8-19d7-4355-b493-456f3a089785",
                                "sense_id": "6655f2c4-ca74-322b-81c8-7a00fbdf80f9",
                                "text": "C'était une cité assez coquette, avec ses maisons de bois balustrade, son Kremlin, la coupole pourpre et or de son église, son bazar où, vers l'époque de la foire d'Irbit, campaient des caravanes tartares venues de Semipalatinsk, de Merv et de Bokhara."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a42a102f-5379-34f4-9db4-79371aceae88",
                        "entry_id": "bb1ad851-a771-3498-aabe-49bed2d6a26c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Résidence des tsars à Moscou, Kremlin."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fce6b80d-18fe-4880-8fd7-4bd8ccec2109",
                                "sense_id": "a42a102f-5379-34f4-9db4-79371aceae88",
                                "text": "Et Dieu les a tous pris […],\n Le puissant, le repu, l’assouvi qui se vautre,\n Le czar dans son kremlin."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6f9e1d84-bcf7-4d39-80ba-a1549565bd20",
                        "source_entry_id": "bb1ad851-a771-3498-aabe-49bed2d6a26c",
                        "target_lang_word": "kremlin",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "kremlin",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "56aa6b00-4189-39b9-86aa-3f18e5d61304",
                                        "entry_id": "05810e2c-d171-3436-9225-28f81b61a2e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fortified, central complex found in various Russian cities."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c0e41cd-42f4-464e-be42-3e707ccd4f43",
                                                "sense_id": "56aa6b00-4189-39b9-86aa-3f18e5d61304",
                                                "text": "9% of historical parks are the gardens of monasteries and kremlins (fortified centres in the towns), 8% are urban (\"public\") gardens and only 2% are parks on urban estates."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "43adcacb-5e7a-4575-87e6-48252a39da9a",
                                                "sense_id": "56aa6b00-4189-39b9-86aa-3f18e5d61304",
                                                "text": "Several cities in Russia were built around fortresses called kremlins. Russians built kremlins for defense during the Middle Ages. A kremlin was often located along a river."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31ff43b8-7e76-4e7f-b422-f152f0e1ad26",
                                                "sense_id": "56aa6b00-4189-39b9-86aa-3f18e5d61304",
                                                "text": "The centre of the kremlin usually held the prince's or voivode’s court, the cathedral, and the bishop's court. This arrangement can be seen in quite a number of 16th-century kremlins. The main street of the kremlin connected this complex with the gate leading to the marketplace."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5067f38b-d723-4670-b283-8f41ed1485d9",
                        "source_entry_id": "bb1ad851-a771-3498-aabe-49bed2d6a26c",
                        "target_lang_word": "кремль",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "кремль",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7941cf68-7b89-3d0f-9786-0cf8dac9fc34",
                                        "entry_id": "75e999d6-afd2-31de-92b3-6f8b31ed5e47",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "истор. в старинных русских городах — внутренняя городская крепость"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a05bc0aa-f515-4546-af1b-00255bc1818a",
                                                "sense_id": "7941cf68-7b89-3d0f-9786-0cf8dac9fc34",
                                                "text": "Это уже или кремли феодальных городов, или укреплённые усадьбы князей и бояр."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
